{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Miracles","Pour la première fois au cinéma, une enquête sur 3 énigmes restées scientifiquement inexpliquées. Ce film documentaire nous entraine sur les traces de la relique la plus analysée au monde, le suaire de Turin, sur une image toujours inexpliquée d’une femme enceinte qui s’est imprimée sur une tunique en fibre végétale du XVIe siècle ainsi que sur des écrits uniques dans l’histoire de l’humanité et qui défient tous les records de la littérature mondiale.",[4],"high rank employment",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":25,"media":27,"synopsis":30,"production":31,"characters":34,"roles":35,"awards":40,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_231","fr2023-231-miracles",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2023-01-01",2023,"Documentary",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Pierre Barnérias","pierre-barnerias",1965,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[26],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":28,"trailerUrl":29},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/208/3/263120/format_page/miracles.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l14qys2ZXy8",{"native":2,"english":10},[32],{"country":23,"share":33},"Majority coproducer",[],[36],{"person":37,"role":39},{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":38},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
